Do inherited
Install menu mMain

# Omnis v10/v11+ compatibility workaround:
# $openlibschanged is a built-in method available since Omnis v11.
# Due to a library conversion bug when GitTools (which maintains Omnis v10 compatibility)
# is converted for Omnis v11, $openlibschanged is never called by Omnis when the method
# was created in an Omnis v10 library. To work around this issue, we create the method
# as a temporary/instance method dynamically instead.
Do $cinst.$methods.$add("$openlibschanged") Returns lvMethod
Calculate lvMethod.$methodtext as "Do tvGitTools.$registerLibraries()"
Do $cinst.["$openlibschanged"]()